{"version":"context-relations-v1-canary","words":{"allegiance":[{"id":"krdict:78861:1","headword":"충절","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"주로 임금이나 나라에 대한 충성스럽고 곧은 마음.","englishExpression":"loyalty; allegiance; fidelity","englishDescription":"One's faithful and righteous attitude, usually when dealing with one's king or country.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=78861&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:78862:1","headword":"충정","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"주로 임금이나 나라에 대한 충성스럽고 참된 마음.","englishExpression":"loyalty; allegiance; fidelity","englishDescription":"A sincere and genuine affection, usually toward one's king or nation.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=78862&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:79100:1","headword":"충","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"임금이나 나라 등에 충성함.","englishExpression":"loyalty; allegiance","englishDescription":"The state of being devoted and faithful to one's king, country, etc.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79100&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:79523:1","headword":"충성","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"주로 임금이나 국가에 대하여 참된 마음에서 우러나오는 정성.","englishExpression":"loyalty; allegiance; fidelity","englishDescription":"A sincere and genuine heart, originating from one's true affection toward one's king or nation.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79523&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:79525:1","headword":"충성심","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"임금이나 나라에 대하여 참된 마음에서 우러나오는 정성스러운 마음.","englishExpression":"loyalty; allegiance; fidelity","englishDescription":"A sincere and genuine heart, originating from one's true affection toward one's king or nation.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWor